Thus, ar ≡ 24 ≡ 1 (mod 15). In this case, r = 4 is even and a(r/2) ≡ 24/2 ≡ 4, where 4 ≢ −1. But this means we have found a root 4 of 1 where 4 ≢ ± 1:
